{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1403,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40d979aa2c9c0d96b6c8ed13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题的……\r\n完全不会\r\n妨碍到训练……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f245f9f5612c3bc8044e5e633454c3daacabb99807ea3fa954512cd37356e128",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2dafcdcf25e01b061c772d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得认真想想\r\n有什么事是现在能做到的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "13b8f0d0c3d0ca92d3e9bd6fe7976dd3e451f5573b0ea6e830955333a33bb4a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dee6546b665d49416affbca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会在应该前进的道路上\r\n迷失方向的……绝对……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f6d11e570af9ebd3e0678b4398b3992864c3750fc9edb22a2ee922870d63186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fab44d6866a5a512d5c47933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下定决心绝对要达成的目标，\r\n可不能在途中就退缩……",
      "source_fingerprint": "97f5221a3943eaf828929670aec445af66e16517738457dac0b54b727f091d2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3471d3915642665fdef29c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇于挑战是很重要，但既然我们把\r\n目标放在更长远之处，有时\r\n重新审视策略也是必要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c29de420355aa3f18233836785ed071797fa12dc7c6e00685a029e9c3cd0110",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:893cb542d7d82138bc99e8e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了获得光芒，休息也是必要的……\r\n我想现在正是该储备力量、\r\n好好休息的时候。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6044f5954ef112d92466dac58d341fba44e43d2cadb238dc7aeefa3d644df272",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56627a36940391c090000467",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出生在这世界的意义是什么──\r\n看来让人们了解的时刻\r\n已经到了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe31e74aa9eb89f203eb71024265f33ac8ee90211d99cf5a105608581a096d22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0d9001f57790293bcc09ea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用至今锻炼出来的实力，\r\n发挥出最强的光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44f132b4222601ad7703113479275e6112dc4af985cee6c4539690d8148b22fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68b728e887d160afbd4f61d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在大舞台上的钻石才更该闪耀！\r\n无论面对高墙还是魔咒，\r\n我都会一一破除！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f47c33c8bd47cfba1c27ddfd8768b737f51c8a542fa336a3ebaf5388c71e89a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:226ce6e7e481f67927c9b5cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天真是适合比赛的好日子呢！\r\n我感到情绪高昂，心跳不已……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ede0a95f14f46e823878d533aef6eb2377c11d4ebd817edb4e5f2fcb1c396832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69243b6a053470c2fc2eefd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我将证明──\r\n只有我才能证明的事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ab681174cd378a4e1b15c270c6c26b4c1c6367321dd0125465d9b39fe3b295b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f73f42c8f0c75f158112bfb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会以这双脚、这颗心……\r\n夺下胜利的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5fbc42453ac990eb6f0cef0eec1c558c072c10a1555dba41bd2abdf89c795cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:230b17b0d44fd24b3424d4b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论对手是谁，\r\n该做的事都是一样的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e421b1345daecd5d306ee00595f76467806470e82b8f59520843855fdca12a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b5f3274b35c5ae46ac9aef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在只须相信自己、全力以赴。\r\n我会试着一如往常地去跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6beabe417436ed9f4b81f76fd0391cc19d6c2ba96599d766cd46c63510459521",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cec482f26c3b190f3592189",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稳稳地固定蹄铁……\r\n好了，这样就行了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13e8cdba658ab82f8c002392602b5088cc743ce4da87bc15ede73331325e7fa8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16a4037fd6ed3c1f9bc4d771",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然已经下定决心，\r\n我就会达成目标……一定……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed26b9176f768c02ab655e3233e15174288cc2a579dfe6f2c3f573b773f04a5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aac568d8f8f56301a393e52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是真有状况不佳时\r\n总是无法获胜的魔咒，\r\n那就由我来破除……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a8f16154fddc7951880b7fe41e4324075869d211475558daf1b591a8054068",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7777572a96a8c18a212e91c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要专注紧盯着前方就\r\n不会有问题，没问题的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "56c850daf9842f170a0b4a17bb2af43974abd974712040ac93533c456345e40a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6343c225921499cf864b6d44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回想至今的努力，\r\n这点小事根本不算什么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6c42514d89691e18706523ed54574271cb2c74801d26662d92622c70bdf345a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ed3173c168a57db3010c61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不被吞噬，\r\n得维持平常心才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec54d852e5989492c4a0759cb09e83948ea19c5821f40aaa4f0188566e483c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0767b695ccdbbec58c46bfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在只须彻底发挥出\r\n既有的实力，全力去挑战……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d71f8dcd675c08236713becce6c05378290752542fdd5bb4c90d6cf9fe246019",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b660e0f8cc018bc88eb903e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a50ec8eaa451966a05c1bfc0873d6ff73ec70a975bb58a60e9173f31c9a7817",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3815083fc9101efce6b2808",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b58d964d17854a803d16140a894079104ae8c9281e306d5f49a7ec42fc0837d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d88883ed1fba2a57ac028c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7db2672b13e863ec4eaa786e798a4c805bcc49790bb2cbaa2a6d57174fa6ba8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75c525c52dbc71be4d31fe88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0dad597dc82a31dd69060476ba8d5a0bc081bd7005ed6641f89ca6ade33857a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c010e2d9eb25b61aa1cb4c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac8fc565cc6e154ca535658e2a1098508116aeddc61ce0c59ba3bf3247db84e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:890833ca24925b6111c684a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a58c7a8ef21296edcd18e040e656c0239f29146a83848363a05d8d1a7f069db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c8f2b5f8b51f3afef563fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d4df1c378c6691186569a6c765800e1e53a23e172fab507412af50571f5b0f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6618418b23ef3e14c6e3664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c6d90feddd69d89c153acf6bc73ca0b067441fa527eeac2a80c7e22cf301fe9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0dd4f964e7b305ceac08f49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得现在可以克服所有的障碍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "887e57d6851c82b926cd429b5eed92e49e1a4e06daba93c8a962d7221b91283c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bb0092fc74fc1ce34c2cef4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你陪在我身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "462de60b5946a28495161426db49175b7c7bd1adb06088c4cc37a363adff8c90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:639068760ba263c7d0a581df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我们出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81c9285449a4e43eab6f0337fe4fb657e0a246e08395f81b0ce4dd9463473719",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a63b51c0d259b9c0f60b1b0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标是获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "414d9cc9e0217a24646342568482f73662e74b9f610102383afcd774e1a93e85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d4d2c6a6813ca6b9495fc10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "聚集光辉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e78fb727e70e8c19b311fde2626db0dfaa373a1ea329726cb270c048dc83d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01cdefb46917d2ae9e77c560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你陪在我身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "462de60b5946a28495161426db49175b7c7bd1adb06088c4cc37a363adff8c90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe898cb950136cb3a3786203",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会以这双脚、这颗心……\r\n夺下胜利的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5fbc42453ac990eb6f0cef0eec1c558c072c10a1555dba41bd2abdf89c795cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cab7a2f5c016a6ba363bf30d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在大舞台上的钻石才更该闪耀！\r\n无论面对高墙还是魔咒，\r\n我都会一一破除！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f47c33c8bd47cfba1c27ddfd8768b737f51c8a542fa336a3ebaf5388c71e89a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b664162e70bd8986d31f273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你陪在我身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "462de60b5946a28495161426db49175b7c7bd1adb06088c4cc37a363adff8c90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b8ad44dcacdffc58c7577e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68e822021704de2d0b17450911975e3353a641db970893dc695ab5dee7eda4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df49d4396ba248b89b01252b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我得……再更加磨练自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cabb266526b82032108b1f6948eb63e960f2a65a07daa9b87b595e8055d2c4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b01e7759bf36a0375f6e298",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定能更加闪耀的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6b84f792f3f828f8d336b405cc731f12413d67e78d7d86e2dc8062c59619cc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec6cbd488349be83f9b94441",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来这次勉强保住光芒了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12b34b2fc96ca0a5a7773f869ec96bd1465221c3343c1b38d9ec7089ec81f336",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2506d3668239500b29a6863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我会将这次的结果谨记在心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4116ba682ce78b759bfba047a0a8e6a8d71332fb84b9db573343d27add49b51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b41bad78f04fca19903b205e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因我坚持相信自己存在的意义、\r\n自己出生的意义……才有这番成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e91871455919314cb246006a80e7a909bd077af8a8f372b1f962351b4a83bd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feecc5e9eef64e10d7d9752d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光钻的光芒看起来如何啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f67249f39190a62531afb9aed85db4f815d38daa67e9c3511348ef33e98453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1075b6b25e0665521c1d3cc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利的朝阳在此升起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bad09eb1aa16c2463434976f0ab993ba6532fe738a483d9b9de47aefe3a329a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada8d4448576573b2cd946d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光钻的光芒看起来如何呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7620713ba735c166963c239abaf94c16eaedf46adde2b9e01e094c51878b5cf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21b2cc71ffc40842e52c44d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "矜持はここに、誇りはここに。そして、勝利も！",
      "source_fingerprint": "daeb622f8a586ff19572082bcb597def95897f7c225b1201da2f1274b6e98c63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f9b25ad1ec54d483dca8c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダイヤの輝き、いかがでしたか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb5fc59cd2a95d3bc4edad45e1b39bb2d20c8a3d5e54ca32e10be4d27586ab91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3914c739a13b8ee7088a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绽放光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "939f1ee158d9b76d470670404c9b882e5d8756049ab47254d2b7212269c6a14c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccfd6a6f3f912d3a4ee88e4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正是绽放光芒之时！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c6c7ff6a744f7209e2374d7969f6ccb562c0cef5f65013f1f018dfcc3af3e44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abd462558566dac4156323b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小北……\r\n看起来跟平常不太一样，对吧？\r\n她是怎么了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "579cebe1373c74d9bb1f53fee454be8ecc4a997f8599c47da7da767b322ed6be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8384ebc3f5a3346985aebdb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家热热闹闹的，玩得好开心！\r\n看来可以跟他们请教很多\r\n不懂的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "243fdcdffe5b867dbf5a517f741563cfafdfdb9a21d554ef8d3e9aca07c371cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65234fd603b4dab7f3027ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金船总是会提出我从没想过的\r\n练习方式！我受到很多刺激，\r\n学到很多呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17306305b9c9ca8ed7c4c31004b35f5c3c37a060d129dbb5ac027d5a1a8cfa80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:596920c879665f54945c01d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诗歌剧她该不会\r\n远比我们想象的还要更……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3f88a0883f4c113d0f036aca5e3f14e7ee73a06502936f2a36bacadff401453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3d9b7823b5a191fbe2c78f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园的「魔物」……\r\n希望有一天能亲眼看看本尊呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5350afd7b0920b1cc1b6d8cc3b7c31fbe1fefa513b9998107ea7744021794a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f151d565aaf6deb47b1907ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我胸中这道希望之光──\r\n现在，照亮属于我的道路吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de204086e0fedccbf74f514c60da260776b5ec029881d9ab473037bd32bee8c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73cc7dea0b6a754168f6b2dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "写给父亲大人及母亲大人……\r\n「光钻会和小北一起加油的。」\r\n……呵呵，好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bfd3ec4db6df74eae10661174a5848957cfe6211f4992289b2bd0fee5d4a942",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b2b49632a57dd9c7d7bdb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝阳啊，升起吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2004146f74a4c4b17aacd04e5722fa909f36f614701895ddc71e261f72d318f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0b13f09434dc24a1d3dbe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一定会在日出前爬上巅峰。\r\n因为大家都是那么用心地\r\n在替我们加油打气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c80f972b189fc1fbce205b8c3fd336613c5a0a4ba29d88e56ff9816fe7eb47b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef6afc141afa44622a8d0beb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是多黑暗的夜晚……\r\n都必定会结束！曙光出现了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d1518cd1a4b4bad42f543d4c39185164c13203375aa3117b41982f2a1699024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:839ab8b7a2f91d6d93bd7160",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年会抽到什么签呢……？\r\n呵呵，无论运势如何，\r\n我都会亲手掌握幸福♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b50992edb5877469be5d62dea33f59222d21408ef0f0c1e5a7fd2e048649f0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "400042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9ce024cace1faa1ca2ac2a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越えてみせる…すべてを！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0323c34a194c097a82ce57d2c09b09b001325485ee6b885900f3076c0d9a3467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c949026dc6e9754a3bc6459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぬかるみも茨も、遥かな壁も…すべて！\r\n私が越えるためにある！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d2dbcce937eb2422730573122bde1c8ec5fc16e75de287c2c61a713848258cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a75a808b79e60d07d4b60d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感到一股不同于比赛的紧张感呢。\r\n……呵呵，我的心跳开始加快了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccdafe587a6ec4e5f84aa0b465012791d64c10257ad6411061530da99b9c98d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd63c2b65ff9fdc148c8929",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看着我在舞台上\r\n闪耀光芒的身影！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0bd6d5c87717820b79bec94203e9452472f904a5703ac7cdf5c97ec936e0563",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c141d5fc0a1a5c76e39e707",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小女子不才，还请多多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af364d3fe7fb8b19f667aacc311692de144f04f77daed3277ce9af14068c8423",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c285dd09b4a11a8023c9652",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为训练员你\r\n理解我的梦想，\r\n所以我才决定要跟你一起前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04362c8ad96e89c5021e7d879971eba0957f29b328fdb8ed9e2ae4f3c800524e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0bf82a41e85980eeede22f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园中满是各种有趣的事物。\r\n看来我可以度过快乐的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b9013d0b3c8a02ebfe58caf20a8c31e1779dbe12fbc6397d6c47dfa6c9ab44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ff97e447ce63df16e24b84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这样穿……是正确的吗？\r\n穿上露肚子的衣服对我来说很新鲜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98be02baf2f924fa125b697adb862134641d128fb91960c652a2c533c605f1d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a380d4a16ce08138788d920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "钻石将绽放光芒──\r\n既坚强又优美，无比闪耀的光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "660d975f5f751514da2fd2329ae2acd213ed4d160070a108c9e7f4cf36d3da50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0668e0829652f61140389da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然我已经穿上这套制服，\r\n接下来可就无法收手了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef587b9cfbc79221d0b44db4a890d501bcbb066788df7e3aa1ac1253e44b967",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c91056852cae171ae36760f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站上舞台能令人更加闪耀。\r\n所以我会全力以赴，绝不懈怠♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c44ed6a8b055a8892fa84d7e378f925e56a8d171f6222772c24a2e1d93a54507",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599ae1efd0f83cda1077b799",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "柔美的荷叶边能为我增添华丽气息。\r\n但前提是我自己要先绽放光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "249d3672eba89845eac1aaa1a636abf7fbb0f73412bc59e0b19d19c9f1a8afbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca85a36406d5827661f6e47e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这丰富的色彩，\r\n让人觉得能度过清新的一年呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e96387f36ebe72312980a63591cd40152add36036acba18e80b5848b830a2074",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1da10d92827d198bc7c700e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会抵达耀眼的巅峰……\r\n我感觉到了那样的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c87fe746d05326249c187c508e108776b9a3b4a2e340ff7be1ba00cd2153030",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f4571632d1740599a70d78e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？适合我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "587d4810e9777d4061316f8b6e50f8bc787c4031edf6dd846afa8760985812a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16f66a496c850668dbc014ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要放进展示柜里♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f1c25471f72eb882c3328f2cfc083be01edba0bcbe926d42f0401e1fde8183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbce3af7e864777dc484a35a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你打算去哪里呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7078a96644618ab8d3c0b36a9ffbfa9dfc0eaa58be151c6331c9214ffb7648",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60066122350ca187686d92e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身打扮根本跑不动……\r\n那不过是种魔咒，我不会受影响喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e343d8ab80e9d068fb509e49c6480b53a7e74cf8df28d998d0b3a62c1d11c0c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70021"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
